4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nZZeNhtMHU8Q7kNvwFM_8Kb&_nc_oc=AdpYVXKgXUCjlah3c3Yke3gAarSyzi0P6rT57xGzY73fX_Lv4ZWsFn-lFspgUZitmZ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2lux4qQ-Xdn44SPDc3TE-r4YJrzT9wKDYLJkmA6kHRNw&oe=69D65254"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YyEkuaN6fZcQ7kNvwEyWqwH&_nc_oc=AdqRw6bAMDKSxQ4qBzO8A5Q7CPKObv6uNPvKYvwQV695vVgRG6jYjM4sqL-WlGaIxCY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1c6wAassMgnpHWLFLtMW3zfPIqT4rZ7Wj4kOwQJHyNgQ&oe=69D65732"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TPKZY-1yCIAQ7kNvwFkp7Pb&_nc_oc=AdqnDcPO_8RXpo234pRGeb9CMGxE3pPem8tpcSBLi2PqkClog7_F1C5Ys4APxdiCVws&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1iNg3uPLOdViTHI-9RVhiCRQS1sbS--bBhjNGL3qseww&oe=69D664D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p